notes.content:
1) The mobility of the battle group is calculated for all platoons together, not individually for each platoon.
2) Units from disbanded platoons and suitable reserves can replenish the main part of platoons.
3) Added I-152 aircraft.
4) Changed and expanded operations in the Fateful Strike DLC.
5) The position in the battle is remembered for units from platoons that did not move in the operational phase (including to/from the reserve).
6) Revised the algorithm for moving BGs/platoons with indirect control mode in the operational phase:
-the march order is automatically canceled if it is impossible to execute or in a contact with an enemy for non-combat and “weak” units;
-the march order is automatically replaced by an attack, for combat units in a contact with an enemy;
-movement is carried out so that each BG/platoon move approaches its destination;
- during march order, BGs/platoons try to avoid contact with the enemy.
